Package: PolandTripPlanner
Title: Poland Trip Planning with Time Allocation and Route Discovery
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kamilla", "Tadjibaeva", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "kamilla.tadjibaeva@student.edu")
Description: Provides tools for planning trips to Poland including intelligent
    time allocation across cities based on their cultural and historical
    significance, and scenic route discovery that identifies interesting
    stops along the way. Uses S3 and R6 class systems, C++ via Rcpp
    for performance-critical distance computations, and defensive programming
    throughout.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    R6,
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
